---
description: Conventions for files in models/
globs: models/**/*.sql
alwaysApply: false
---

- Model files are named `<layer>_<entity>.sql` in snake_case, for example `stg_orders.sql`.
  The layer is `stg`, `int` or `mart`.
- Every new model starts with a comment line `-- owner: <team>` within its first three lines.
- A change to a model under `models/marts/` needs an updated `models/marts/schema.yml`.
